  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p>If you have been prone since the end of your last turn, you increase the bonus to your AC against ranged attacks made against you to +6, as well doubling the Perception DC modifier due to distance or unfavorable conditions to observers attempting to notice you (in the case of distance, this would increase the DC to notice you by +2 per 10 feet), and you gain concealment—you can make Stealth checks using this concealment while prone at a -5 penalty while crawling, or at no penalty if you do not move or are maintaining the light step approach.</p>\n<p>Additionally, you can move at half speed while you are prone, instead of just 5 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Associated Feats</strong>: Fast Crawl (<em>Faction Guide</em>), Lie Low (<em>Ranged Tactics Toolbox</em>), Prone Shooter (<em>Ultimate Combat</em>).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/infiltration#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
